e">Pam Pichaya</h2><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">Cheg at Potong</p></div><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">Bangkok</p></div></div></div></a></div><div id="w-node-_65904593-024a-cf6a-a35d-cb3e8dbeb611-6b801054" role="listitem" class="expert__card-wrapper home-page-grid w-dyn-item"><a href="/experts/phil-rosenthal" class="link_wrapper_expert w-inline-block"><div class="expert__picture-wrapper"><div class="expert-picture4 w-embed"><img src="https://production-data.worldofmouth.app/images/1c9dc094-1a29-4891-bf8b-9ed774a66e60-1080x1080.jpg" alt="Phil Rosenthal" class="expert-picture4"></div><div class="text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-style-h6 text-color-white">Phil Rosenthal</h2><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">Host at Netflix show Somebody Feed Phil</p></div><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">Los Angeles</p></div></div></div></a></div><div id="w-node-_65904593-024a-cf6a-a35d-cb3e8dbeb611-6b801054" role="listitem" class="expert__card-wrapper home-page-grid w-dyn-item"><a href="/experts/manu-buffara" class="link_wrapper_expert w-inline-block"><div class="expert__picture-wrapper"><div class="expert-picture4 w-embed"><img src="https://production-data.worldofmouth.app/images/97ab05a8-8055-4f21-9c4a-063c898a61db-1080x1080.jpg" alt="Manu Buffara" class="expert-picture4"></div><div class="text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-style-h6 text-color-white">Manu Buffara</h2><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">Chef at Restaurante Manu</p></div><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">Curitiba</p></div></div></div></a></div><div id="w-node-_65904593-024a-cf6a-a35d-cb3e8dbeb611-6b801054" role="listitem" class="expert__card-wrapper home-page-grid w-dyn-item"><a href="/experts/junghyun-park" class="link_wrapper_expert w-inline-block"><div class="expert__picture-wrapper"><div class="expert-picture4 w-embed"><img src="https://production-data.worldofmouth.app/images/bb3ac822-fa33-4071-a323-50597bd0783f-1080x1080.jpg" alt="Junghyun Park" class="expert-picture4"></div><div class="text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-style-h6 text-color-white">Junghyun Park</h2><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">Chef at ATOMIX</p></div><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">New York</p></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div fs-list-instance="expert" fs-list-element="list" role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div id="w-node-_65904593-024a-cf6a-a35d-cb3e8dbeb620-6b801054" role="listitem" class="expert__card-wrapper home-page-grid show-mobile-landscape w-dyn-item"><a href="/experts/quique-dacosta" class="link_wrapper_expert w-inline-block"><div class="expert__picture-wrapper"><div class="expert-picture4 w-embed"><img src="https://production-data.worldofmouth.app/images/ae531413-32c2-415a-a3fd-5f12a8b0b001-1080x1080.jpg" alt="Quique Dacosta" class="expert-picture4"></div><div class="text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-style-h6 text-color-white">Quique Dacosta</h2><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">Chef at Quique Dacosta</p></div><div class="text-color-grey"><p class="expert-profession-origin">Denia</p></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><p class="text-align-center text-color-white">And +800 other Experts.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="section-key-features"><div class="code-embed-9 w-embed"><style>
  .carousel-wrapper-key-features {
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scroll-padding-left: 2.5rem;
    scroll-padding-right: 2.5rem;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none; /* Firefox */
    -ms-overflow-style: none; /* IE / old Edge */
  }

  .carousel-wrapper-key-features::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none; /* Chrome, Safari, new Edge */
  }

  .card-key-feature {
    width: calc(100vw - 5rem - 3rem);
    max-width: 80rem;
    flex: 0 0 calc(100vw - 5rem - 3rem);
    scroll-snap-align: start;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
    .carousel-wrapper-key-features {
      scroll-padding-left: 1.25rem;
      scroll-padding-right: 1.25rem;
    }

    .card-key-feature {
      width: calc(100vw - 2.5rem - 2rem);
      flex: 0 0 calc(100vw - 2.5rem - 2rem);
    }
  }
</style></div><div class="code-embed-10 w-embed w-script">

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const carousel = document.querySelector('.carousel-wrapper-key-features');
    const cards = carousel.querySelectorAll('.card-key-feature');
    const dots = document.querySelectorAll('.pagination-dot');
    const prevButton = document.querySelector('.carousel-arrow-prev');
    const nextButton = document.querySelector('.carousel-arrow-next');

    let currentIndex = 0;
    let autoplay;

    function updateDots(index) {
      currentIndex = index;

      dots.forEach((dot, i) => {
        dot.classList.toggle('is-active', i === index);
      });
    }

    function getCurrentSlide() {
      const carouselRect = carousel.getBoundingClientRect();
      const scrollPadding = window.innerWidth <= 767 ? 1.25 : 2.5;
      const targetLeft = carouselRect.left + scrollPadding * 16;

      let closestIndex = 0;
      let smallestDistance = Infinity;

      cards.forEach((card, index) => {
        const cardRect = card.getBoundingClientRect();
        const distance = Math.abs(cardRect.left - targetLeft);

        if (distance < smallestDistance) {
          smallestDistance = distance;
          closestIndex = index;
        }
      });

      return closestIndex;
    }

    function goToSlide(index) {
      const targetIndex = (index + cards.length) % cards.length;
      const card = cards[targetIndex];

      const cardRect = card.getBoundingClientRect();
      const carouselRect = carousel.getBoundingClientRect();
      const scrollLeft = carousel.scrollLeft + (cardRect.left - carouselRect.left);

      carousel.scrollTo({
        left: scrollLeft,
        behavior: 'smooth',
      });

      updateDots(targetIndex);
      startAutoplay();
    }

    function nextSlide() {
      goToSlide(currentIndex + 1);
    }

    function previousSlide() {
      goToSlide(currentIndex - 1);
    }

    function startAutoplay() {
      clearInterval(autoplay);
      autoplay = setInterval(nextSlide, 5000);
    }

    function stopAutoplay() {
      clearInterval(autoplay);
    }

    prevButton.addEventListener('click', previousSlide);
    nextButton.addEventListener('click', nextSlide);

    dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
      dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
        goToSlide(index);
      });
    });

    carousel.addEventListener('scrollend', () => {
      updateDots(getCurrentSlide());
    });

    updateDots(0);

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        entries.forEach((entry) => {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            startAutoplay();
          } else {
            stopAutoplay();
          }
        });
      },
      { threshold: 0.5 },
    );

    observer.observe(carousel);
  });
